raja: +1 after link fix and caption update. Tony: +1 for schema and examples.

ton y: +1 (tiny nit: change wording "may" -> "might" in that sentence).

nicole: Thanks all I'll merge after evie's link patch lands and post a short changelog with the snippet sandbox link. :ship:
